WEBVTT

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:13.800
In the great sea of Ignora lay five islands in the shape of a cross.

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.060
Four pointed in each cardinal direction around a larger one in the center

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.980
to form Ente Isla, the islands watched over by the gods.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:30.190
All who lived in Ente Isla knew of Satan, ruler of demons.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.070
His very name was synonymous with the terror and cruelty

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.330
which ruled this demon realm teeming with creatures of the night.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:45.170
Satan's ambition was to conquer the human world

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:50.880
and build there a land of peace and prosperity for all night's creatures.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.760
He had four trusted generals:

00:00:56.970 --> 00:01:02.680
Adramelech, Lucifer, Alciel, and Malacoda.

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:07.650
These four great demons launched attacks on the four continents.

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:42.350
However, a lone hero rose up against them, sacred sword in hand.

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:52.480
Along with a band of comrades, the hero crushed Lucifer's army to the west.

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:57.160
They went on to defeat Adramelech in the north and Malacoda in the south,

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:00.240
and then the federation of knights led by this hero

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:04.830
invaded the central continent, where the lord of demons kept his castle.

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:33.570
Damn! You wretched humans...!

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.570
Divine souls, gather in the realm of the dead.
Stop the demons and drag them to the netherworld!

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.030
What?!

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:43.280
How dare you!

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:19.950
Sire!

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:22.990
Out of my way!

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.950
I am sorry, Sire.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:31.170
The human forces are steadily overcoming my army.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:35.300
It is only a matter of time before this castle falls.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:39.050
I never dreamed a single human "hero"

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:42.970
could force us into such dire straits...

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:45.640
Sire,

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:49.140
I suggest we withdraw for now and regroup.

00:03:58.150 --> 00:03:59.150
Hear me, humans!

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:02.660
I shall leave Ente Isla in your hands today!

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:04.700
But know this: I shall return

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:09.620
to subjugate you and all of Ente Isla!

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.220
Where are we?!

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:29.100
Are you all right, Sire?

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:33.850
Alciel, the first thing we must do is find a place to heal.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:34.980
Yes, Sire.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:38.730
But this seems an awfully noisy place...

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:51.410
Wh-What is this world?!

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:52.870
Could it--

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:57.540
Sire?! Why do you take that form?!

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:58.710
What?

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:01.130
These are...

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.880
...human hands?

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.510
Calm yourself, Alciel.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.980
We must be careful not to use magic.

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:14.690
Excuse me, you there!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.650
Could I talk to you for a minute?

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:20.020
Do not speak to me so familiarly, lowly human!

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:21.900
Do you wish to die?

00:05:22.110 --> 00:05:24.490
Uh-oh, they're foreigners.

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.700
Okay, do you boys understand Japanese?

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:29.160
You look injured. Were you in a fight?

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:32.370
Why?! Even if they do not speak our language,

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:35.790
I am a demon, a user of magic--

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.580
Alciel.

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:43.130
Do not use your magic now.
Not until we learn of this world.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:46.380
Aren't they hot, dressed like that?

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:51.930
They're "cosplaying," Sir. Don't see that much in this neighborhood, though.

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:56.600
This is Sasaki on patrol duty. I've got some boys with minor injuries here.

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:59.770
--This seems to be a carriage...
--The victims are foreigners from somewhere in Asia.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:02.780
--But it doesn't require horses...
--We're in west Shinjuku, area 1-20.

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:08.870
--It doesn't seem to be powered by magic...
--Not sure whether they're tourists or residents.

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:13.080
Now, can I get you to join us in the car? If nothing's wrong--

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:18.000
Do not presume to touch me, lowly human!

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:20.880
Know your place, you inferior creature!

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:29.340
Okay, you two behave yourselves.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:42.190
Um, this is <i>katsudon</i>, okay?

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.190
<i>Katsu... don...</i>

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.400
Yes, yes.

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:52.580
They coated animal flesh in some sort of grain and fried it in hot oil.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:56.080
Then they put a mashed-up bird egg on top,

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:58.960
and heated it even further in a fish broth...

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:02.460
I'm not actually supposed to feed you,

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:06.420
but you two are injured, so we'll just call it my treat.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:11.760
<i>I want more information about this world.</i>

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:14.930
What? Oh, yes.

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:17.480
Answer my questions.

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:21.810
Alciel.

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:26.730
Alciel?

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:27.820
Satan!

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:29.950
H-Hey, you can't just come in here!

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:31.490
<i>Silence.</i>

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:33.990
Y-Yes, Sir...

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:35.540
King Satan...

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:38.790
I'm so glad you're all right.

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:48.170
I used hypnotism to gain some information about this world...

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:51.130
Apparently we've come to a world called "Earth."

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:55.180
We're in one of its nations, an archipelago called "Japan."

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:59.180
We stand now in its capital of "Tokyo,"

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:02.730
and this building is someplace called a "police station."

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:06.770
The police are evidently a state institution which maintains public order.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:10.280
I see. And what is that substance on the table?

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:14.950
"Katsu Doon." It's an extremely common food in this country.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.030
"Katsu Doon"...

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:21.710
Yes, that has a powerful ring to it.
This is of great interest.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:26.590
What? N-No, it's not particularly important.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:30.880
In this world, things like spell-casting, magic, demons, and the Devil

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:34.930
are considered fantasies-- things that don't really exist.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:38.350
Magic doesn't exist?! How could that be?!

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:45.060
I see, so the insufficient magic here

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.980
left us unable to retain our demonic forms?

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:53.740
Yes. But who would have thought we'd look like <i>this</i> stripped of our magic...

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:59.120
Perhaps humans actually form the basis of all living creatures.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.080
You jest, Sire.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:05.080
I'm sure it's merely an effect of this world and the Gate.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.750
I still retain some of my magic.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:11.010
It's quite an effort to stem its outward flow, though.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:13.010
What about you, Alciel?

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:26.650
King Satan, is this...?

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:30.820
No, I highly doubt you conjured this with magic.

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:32.280
Oh.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:37.110
If I adjust the amount of magic
I release, I won't run out for a while.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:40.370
The real problem is that we have no way to amass more.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:44.330
Still, if Earth is familiar with the concept of magic, even as "imaginary,"

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:47.920
there may be some method of recovering our powers.

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:53.840
The path left to us is to discover that method and get them back.

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:56.970
Until then, we have no choice

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:59.300
but to live in this world and obey these humans' rules.

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:01.810
What a cruel reality this is.

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:04.850
Yes. Our first step is...

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:12.860
...to obtain "records" and "certificates of residence" at this "ward office."

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:17.070
Sire...

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:19.950
H-Hmm?

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:20.910
Here.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:25.250
All right. Next, we create accounts at the "bank."

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:27.160
To do so, we use this.

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:28.870
What is that paper?

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:30.750
It's this country's currency.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:33.170
I borrowed it from that police person.

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:37.220
We also need a seal.
I whipped one up for myself.

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:38.380
Most impressive.

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:39.680
Here you are.

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:45.020
Good. Now we just need to secure a base of operations from a "real-tore."

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:49.350
We are searching house!

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:51.400
What sort of home do you have in mind, Sir?

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:52.820
He understood you!

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:55.110
C-Calm down, Alciel!

00:10:55.320 --> 00:11:01.660
A little language acquisition is nothing for me!

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:05.330
O-Okay! I'm in the groove here!

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:11.880
The landlady here is a very admirable person.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:16.010
If I may speak frankly, she says she wants to set an example

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.630
by taking on persons of unknown background, like you.

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:20.760
Th-This is...

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:24.060
Yes. Even I can tell...

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:27.930
Well, at least it's a two-story house...

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:30.270
And it has six rooms.

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:33.480
You'd be renting room 201 here.

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:35.820
We get <i>one</i> room?

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:39.360
I suppose we should be grateful it has a roof...

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:41.240
Certainly when you compare it to the Devil's Castle, it's a bit--

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:43.240
Good afternoon.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:46.830
Is it... human?

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:51.000
You two are the new rental applicants, correct?

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:52.290
It spoke...?!

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:55.750
This is the apartment owner. She lives next door.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:57.880
I am Miki Shiba.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:00.930
That's "Miki" spelled with the kanji for "beauty" and "radiance."

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:07.810
Oh, but do feel free to call me "Mikitty."

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:09.520
Right...

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:13.940
Sire, are you sure this is the right place for us?

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:18.530
It seems that in this world they say "patience is a virtue."

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:21.360
This style of Devil's Castle will make a nice change.

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:23.280
Oh, Sire...

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:29.160
From here, we shall take a new step... for... ward...

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:32.250
King Satan! King Satan!

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.750
King Satan!

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:42.220
I didn't realize this body required food!

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:44.470
It <i>is</i> a human body, Sire.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:50.020
Not to mention that "IV drip" thing cost a full month's rent on the castle!

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:53.230
You know what they call that here? "Rubbing salt into a wound"!

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:58.320
Sire, that uncanny landlady spared us a good deal of trouble.

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
She tells me that Japan requires residents to carry health ins--

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:06.530
Anyway! Money is clearly of the essence in this human society.

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:09.160
I can't afford to expend any more of my magic, either.

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:12.160
Which means we have only one choice left.

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.330
What is that, Sire?

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:19.250
Whoops, I did it wrong.

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:23.170
You idiot! Résumé forms don't grow on trees, you know!

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:25.970
Okay, I'm "Sadao Maou"...

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:29.560
"Shiro Ashiya"... Do you think this name is strange, Sire?

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:33.520
It's too late to ask me that!
We already made IDs!

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:45.740
King Satan.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:46.860
Yeah?

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:50.620
Might I suggest you put a little more thought into your spending?

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:55.500
I'm thinking plenty!
Summer's coming, so we need a fridge,

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:59.540
and owning a laundry machine is cheaper than coin laundry in the long run.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.960
The bike is essential for commuting to work.

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:05.220
That's not the issue, Sire!

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:08.720
I'm questioning why you didn't pay in installments.

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:10.430
I hate loans.

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:11.760
Now look here--

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:15.390
And installment plans come with fees, you know!

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:18.400
I ain't paying for something
I can't touch with my own hands!

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:21.730
In that case, let me ask you this:

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:26.610
How are we supposed to make it to payday on milk, konjac jelly, and cucumbers?!

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:28.740
Well...

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:31.740
It's not like we've got <i>no</i> money left!

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:35.040
I've still got some in my wallet!

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:38.370
And hey, they give me meals at work!

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:41.420
We'll die.

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:44.590
You propose we eat burgers and fries three times a day until payday?!

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:45.550
What is this, <i>Super Size Me</i>?

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.340
You plan to eat a high-calorie, high-cholesterol diet from a young age?

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:48.010
I look forward to ten years from now!

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:49.470
I just hope you don't die prematurely of a lifestyle-related illness before we get home!

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:50.510
I must apologize for my cowardice, Sire,

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:51.800
but you're the one who argued for biding our time!

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:53.310
You of all people ought to prize constant diligence and health maintenance!

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:55.430
Put a sock in it! I'm going to work!

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:56.350
Wait, Sire!

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:57.600
Lecture me later!

00:14:57.810 --> 00:15:00.020
No, I mean you forgot your umbrella!

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:02.230
Let's go, Dullahan!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:09.070
Well, I suppose I'll get ready too.

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:39.890
Here.

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:41.310
Please, use this.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.060
Er, um...

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:48.110
I work right nearby.
At the MgRonald's by the train station.

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:51.660
All right...

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:53.660
I don't even care if you throw it out!

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:56.240
Yeesh, that's cold!

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:08.050
This week is key! It decides who sells the most of our feature item in our district!

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:12.800
I swear, I <i>will</i> break the sales record for black pepper fries!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.140
Welcome to MgRonald's. May I take your order?

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:20.890
A cheeseburger and a small cola.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:25.400
May I interest you in some black pepper fries?
They're our featured item.

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:26.860
No, thanks.

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:29.900
--Yes, these little continuous efforts are necessary
--One cheeseburger and one small cola--

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:31.820
--that will be 220 yen.

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:32.900
--for my eventual comeback as lord of demons!

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:32.910
--Here's 1,000.

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:34.530
Let me get your change.

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:37.660
That's one chicken burger, one iced coffee, and one Happiness Meal.

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:39.450
730 yen, please!

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:45.040
Oh, would you like to use our microwave, Ma'am?

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:47.710
If you've brought baby food that can go in the microwave,

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:50.420
I'll heat it up while you wait.

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:53.510
You're sure you wouldn't mind?

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:55.010
My pleasure, Ma'am.

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:03.520
Mr. Maou, you're really amazing!

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:06.480
I can't believe you thought of her baby food, even!

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:08.070
Oh, that.

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:12.530
Accommodating our customers' needs when we have the time

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:14.610
gives us a long-term advantage.

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:17.910
You're so cool! You're like a real working adult!

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:21.410
Er, well, it is only a part-time job...

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.430
Another job lost, Ashiya.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:36.140
Please call me "Alciel," Sire.

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:42.310
Anyway, our goal is to return to Ente Isla, not to do day labor!

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:44.480
As you say, Sire.

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:47.100
You find us a way to get back our magic.

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:48.110
Sire?

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:52.190
I'll work and earn us money. You use your brains.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:55.650
This world knows the concepts of magic and spell-casting.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:57.660
Maybe if we trace them to their source...

00:17:57.870 --> 00:17:59.990
You believe we'll be able to recover our powers?!

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:04.910
Yes. And then we won't stop at Ente Isla.

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:07.670
I say we rule <i>this</i> world, too!

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:08.830
Sire!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:11.090
You mean "Maou."

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:18.720
As you wish, Sire. I, Alciel, vow to discover the path to your supremacy!

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:22.100
Rise, Alciel. You're embarrassing me.

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:25.520
And yet...

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:27.940
Hey! I got a 100-yen-per-hour raise!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:30.980
Listen, the guy who started today is pretty good!

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:34.360
You're at the bottom of the totem pole, Sire!

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:38.910
If the Devil is an underling, what does that make <i>me</i>?!

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:43.290
Not that I've made progress on this front either...

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:46.960
And with only books to go on, all I can do is speculate...

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.920
Oh, an earthquake.

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:56.800
Mr. Maou, it's an earthquake.

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:59.220
Yes, yes it is.

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:01.970
Hey, Chi.

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:03.260
Yes?

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:04.890
Everyone makes mistakes.

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:09.690
But it's the sixth time I've dropped fries on the floor this month!

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:13.270
True, you do drop them every other day.

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:16.990
I just clean up after myself while everybody else waits on customers...

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:20.530
At this rate potatoes will start sprouting from the floor!

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:24.790
Hey, you kids on break.

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:26.250
What's wrong, Chi?

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:27.790
What's wrong, Manager?

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:29.830
Call me "Miss Kisaki"!

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:31.580
It's getting crowded out there.

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:33.540
When your breaks are up,
I want you operating at full power.

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:36.170
This is when the fight for #1 really gets in gear.

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:37.840
I'm counting on you.

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:43.930
Oh, and try not to plant too many potatoes, Sasaki.

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:45.350
Yes, Ma'am.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:50.980
--One MgBurger meal with black pepper fries!
--One order of large black pepper fries, please!

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:52.060
Welcome to MgRonald's.

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:54.270
A smile, please!

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:59.150
W-Welcome to MgRonald's...

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:03.950
If we keep this up, we can do it!
We can make #1 in the district!

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:07.120
They're not done yet?

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:09.620
Don't tell me the fryer's broken?!

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:12.670
Did it <i>have</i> to be the black pepper fryer?!

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:15.380
Okay, Maou, focus! What now?

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:18.590
If I don't do something, making #1 is the least of our problems!

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:23.760
Do I use my magic?

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:27.760
Please save your magic for emergencies, Sire.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.280
What's wrong?

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:42.240
Life is fail.

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:44.780
It's not your fault, Mr. Maou.

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:47.620
And the repairman should be done by evening!

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:49.790
Hey, Maa, got a second?

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:51.120
Yeah.

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:56.250
What's going on? Is she gonna blame me for us not getting #1?

00:20:56.460 --> 00:21:00.130
No, it's not like <i>I</i> broke it...

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:03.510
Or does she suspect me because
I was about to use magic?!

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.720
Thanks for waiting! Here we go.

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:09.140
At ease, kid. It's not bad news.

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:12.390
I just got the approval from the district office.

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:13.890
Uh, what?

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:18.400
Sadao Maou, as of today,
I'm promoting you to A-level staff.

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:22.400
All <i>right</i>!

00:21:22.610 --> 00:21:26.780
I'm A-level staff, Ashiya! I got a raise!

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:31.200
Hey.

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.660
Huh? Oh, it's you.

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:36.080
I went to your restaurant after we spoke.

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:41.130
Oh, you did? I didn't see you.
You should've said something!

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:44.930
I watched you all day from the bookstore across the street.

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:49.350
You look so different that
I thought I was mistaken, but...

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:51.520
You started to cast a spell.

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:54.390
A spell...?

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:58.150
Wait, are you--?!

00:21:59.270 --> 00:22:03.400
Why exactly are you working part-time at MgRonald's, Satan?!

00:22:03.610 --> 00:22:05.780
Emilia the hero?!

00:22:23.130 --> 00:22:28.510
<i>Where will morning start from, in this quiet sky?</i>

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:34.140
<i>Fingertips twining in a pinky</i> <i>swear I pretended not to see</i>

00:22:34.350 --> 00:22:44.350
<i>If the moon's been laughed at,</i> <i>she'll sink away toward yesterday</i>

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:50.280
<i>Liar, coward--if I'm all these things at once</i>

00:22:50.490 --> 00:22:56.000
<i>Then I only blossomed in dreams</i>

00:22:56.200 --> 00:23:01.540
<i>I hid in the moon's shadow,</i> <i>but the truth is, I was crying</i>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:07.260
<i>The tears won't flow anymore--</i> <i>did they all dry up?</i>

00:23:07.470 --> 00:23:13.810
<i>If I could forgive everything,</i> <i>maybe they'd flow again</i>

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:21.350
<i>But these are all things I want to protect</i>
